   "extras": {
    "edit_note": "Placeholder \u5b66\u5712 (kindergarten to high school on one campus), 260 x 220 plot, the street at -Y: the park strip open to the street (25 m), the fence + \u6821\u9580 at x -60; ONE main building (an L along the back and the west side, the yellow kindergarten at its front end with its own garden), the gym/auditorium at the back-east, the athletics ground in the middle, the baseball field in the east (home plate at the front-west corner). Shut for now; the main building's interior is a later mission piece."
   },
